# kokoro-js pulls in onnxruntime-node, whose install script downloads CUDA
# binaries on Linux. Nothing here uses them: the extension runs onnxruntime-web,
# and the tests never load onnxruntime-node. The 1.21.0 download started
# returning 404, which failed `npm ci` in CI (000046).
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
